{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05774","headline":"追凉历下古城西北隅此地有清泉乔木 · 卢象","name":"追凉历下古城西北隅此地有清泉乔木","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢朓出华省，王祥贻佩刀。\n前贤真可慕，衰病意空劳。\n贞悔不自卜，游随共尔曹。\n未能齐得丧，时复诵离骚。\n闲荫七贤地，醉餐三士桃。\n苍苔虞舜井，乔木古城壕。\n渔父偏相狎，尧年不可逃。\n蝉鸣秋雨霁，云白晓山高。\n咫尺传双鲤，吹嘘借一毛。\n故人皆得路，谁肯念同袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}